{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51747","headline":"落韵诗（二首） 一 · 李如实","name":"落韵诗（二首） 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"路傍伤羸牛，羸牛身已老。\n两眼不能开，四蹄行欲倒。\n牛曾少壮时，岁岁耕田早。\n耕却春秋田，驾车长安道。\n今日领头穿，无人饲水草。\n喘也不能喘，问也没人问。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李如实","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51747.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51747","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}